  {
   "evidence": "Mathlib has only `extChartAt_model_space_eq_id (x : E)` (Mathlib/Geometry/Manifold/IsManifold/ExtChartAt.lean:865), which covers model-space points, not charts of `M`. A grep of the repo for this statement finds only the new private lemma.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Geometry/Manifold/VectorBundle/FiniteBundleAtlas/PositiveDensity.lean",
   "fix": "Make it public under a descriptive name such as `extChartAt_modelWithCornersSelf_eq`, generalised over `\ud835\udd5c`, in a general chart file such as `TauCeti/Geometry/Manifold/Measure/Chart.lean`, and use it from there.",
   "issue": "`private theorem extChartAt_eq : extChartAt \ud835\udcd8(\u211d, E) x = (chartAt E x).toPartialEquiv` holds for any charted space `M` and uses only Mathlib types. Making it `private` in a bundle-atlas/density file hides general manifold infrastructure.",
   "line": 58
  },
  {
   "evidence": "Statement: `integralL A \u03bc p k h\u03bd hL (ofContMDiffSection A \u03bc p k \u03c3) = \u222b x, L x (\u03c3 x) \u2202\u03bd`. It has no hypotheses beyond instances and the arguments of `integralL`.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Geometry/Manifold/VectorBundle/Sobolev/Integral.lean",
   "fix": "Add `@[simp]` to `integralL_ofContMDiffSection`.",
   "issue": "`integralL_ofContMDiffSection` evaluates `integralL` on `ofContMDiffSection \u03c3` with no side conditions, and its right side is simpler than its left side. Without `@[simp]`, `simp` cannot rewrite the functional on smooth sections.",
   "line": 290
  }
 ],
